<div class="ls-principle-pair">
<article class="ls-principle" data-principle="true" id="alternatives">
<span class="ls-principle-index">15 /</span>
<h3>BUILD AROUND THE WORK YOU KEEP.</h3>
<p>A working life crosses tools, models and years. Give its knowledge a durable home: owned files, visible methods and reversible upkeep. Make the document a place to return to, with the freedom to carry it elsewhere.</p>
</article>
<article class="ls-principle" data-principle="true" id="expertise">
<span class="ls-principle-index">16 /</span>
<h3>LET EXPERTISE TRAVEL.</h3>
<p>Your expertise lives in the questions you ask and the distinctions you notice. Let a useful method preserve some of that care. Richer domain methods and documents that cooperate are a future chapter: more ways for hard-won knowledge to travel.</p>
</article>
